OL,3,AUK doctor infected with Ebola being
OL,4,Atreated at London hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FA British doctor who tested positive
OL,7,Ffor Ebola in the Democratic Republic of
OL,8,FCongo has been flown back to the UK.
OL,10,FThe man, who has not been identified,
OL,11,Flanded at RAF Northolt before being
OL,12,Ftransported to a specialist infectious
OL,13,Fdiseases unit at the Royal Free
OL,14,FHospital in north London.
OL,16,FIt is the first confirmed case of a UK
OL,17,Fnational contracting Ebola during the
OL,18,Fmost recent outbreak of the rare but
OL,19,Fdeadly virus in DR Congo, which has so
OL,20,Ffar led to more than 5,000 deaths.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
