OL,3,AUK doctor infected with Ebola being
OL,4,Atreated at London hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FDr Renu Bindra, deputy director of the
OL,7,FAll Hazards Public Health Response team
OL,8,Fat the UK Health Security Agency
OL,9,F(UKHSA), said there are
OL,10,F"well-established procedures for
OL,11,Fdealing with cases like this" and the
OL,12,Frisk to the public remains low.
